; CLOSE ON appends a C-flagged conversion entry at the day before the close
; date, moving the cost balance left by the price conversion to
; Equity:Conversions:Current at a zero NOTHING price. Its narration renders
; the whole balance like Python's str() of an inventory.
2019-01-01 open Assets:Bank USD
2019-01-01 open Assets:CAD CAD
2019-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2019-01-01 open Income:Salary USD
2019-01-01 open Expenses:Travel CAD

2019-02-01 * "salary"
  Assets:Bank     1000.00 USD
  Income:Salary  -1000.00 USD

2019-02-15 * "buy"
  Assets:Stock   3 HOOL {10.00 USD}
  Assets:Bank

2019-03-01 * "trip"
  Expenses:Travel  100.00 CAD @ 0.75 USD
  Assets:Bank      -75.00 USD

2019-04-01 * "refund"
  Assets:CAD       10.00 CAD
  Expenses:Travel -10.00 CAD

2020-02-01 * "after"
  Assets:Bank      1.00 USD
  Income:Salary   -1.00 USD
